{
  "name": {
    "ja": "1次元Bratu：小さい枝のNewton–GMRES",
    "en": "1D Bratu: Newton–GMRES on the lower branch"
  },
  "scope": {
    "ja": "−u''=λexp(u)、β=1・λ=2β²/cosh²(β/2)の小さい枝を零初期値から解く。31/63/127内部点で解析解、独立に再評価した非線形残差、2次格子収束を確認する。",
    "en": "Solve the lower branch of −u''=λexp(u), with β=1 and λ=2β²/cosh²(β/2), starting at zero. Check the analytic solution, recomputed nonlinear residual and second-order refinement on 31/63/127 interior nodes."
  },
  "assumptions": {
    "ja": "既存の残差十分減少による減衰NewtonとILU(0)付きGMRES。解析解u=2log[cosh(β/2)/cosh(β(x−1/2))]。βtanh(β/2)<2で小さい枝を選び、初期値は全点零。内部Newton制御は非線形許容値1e-10、最大30反復。",
    "en": "Existing residual-decrease damped Newton and ILU(0)-GMRES. Analytic u=2log[cosh(β/2)/cosh(β(x−1/2))]. βtanh(β/2)<2 selects the lower branch and all initial unknowns are zero. Nonlinear tolerance is 1e-10 with at most 30 Newton iterations."
  },
  "units": {
    "ja": "xとuは無次元。λは本規約で無次元化され、次元座標なら逆長さ²に対応する。残差は境界を除いた全内部点のEuclideanノルム。",
    "en": "Dimensionless x and u; λ is nondimensional here and scales as inverse length squared for dimensional coordinates. Residuals use the Euclidean norm of interior equations."
  },
  "boundaries": {
    "ja": "x∈[0,1]、u(0)=u(1)=0。CSVに両端も含める。",
    "en": "x∈[0,1], u(0)=u(1)=0; CSV includes both endpoints."
  },
  "method_ids": [
    "newton"
  ],
  "reading": {
    "ja": "https://hrkoyama.github.io/numerical-methods-atlas/ja/read/sparse-nonlinear/",
    "en": "https://hrkoyama.github.io/numerical-methods-atlas/en/read/sparse-nonlinear/"
  },
