        "en": "Existing source for inexact Newton inner solves, not a proof specific to this recipe."
      }
    }
  ],
  "failure_scope": {
    "ja": "小さい枝・零初期値・固定境界の指定を要求する。大きい枝、臨界点近傍の追跡、分岐、任意初期値からの大域収束は保証しない。解の細格子値を解析解とは呼ばない。",
    "en": "Require the lower-branch declaration, zero initial guess and fixed boundaries. No upper-branch continuation, critical-point tracking, bifurcation or global-convergence guarantee. Fine-grid solutions are not called analytic references."
  },
  "reference_notes": {
    "ja": "CSVは最細格子の数値解・解析解・絶対誤差。JSONには各格子の真の非線形残差、Newton反復数と最小減衰長を記録する。",
    "en": "CSV carries finest-grid numerical/analytic values and absolute error. JSON retains each mesh's nonlinear residual, Newton iteration count and minimum damping length."
  },
